  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Housing coop. training</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kooperativ utbildn bor&#xe4;tt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka den lokala demokratin och det folkliga deltagandet i utvecklingen genom att engagera l&#xe4;genhetsinne- havare i bostadsr&#xe4;ttsf&#xf6;reningar och d&#xe4;rmed i utformandet av sin egen bostadssituation. Utbildning i management av boendekooperativ.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Following the privatisation process,new forms of ownership emerge. Theproject aims at strengthening the organisation of dwelling owners and housing cooperatives by offering training in management of housing co-operatives, using a train the trainer&apos;s approach.</narrative>
  </description>
